# Alfa Oracle trailer /ID (K-ALFA-TRAILER-ID-001)

«Номер документа» у валидатора = PDF trailer `/ID`, не номер операции на лице.

## Oracle SBP / phone / card

- Pair **equal**: `/ID [<A><A>]` (same 32-hex twice), like corpus Oracle origs.
- After any content/FF2 mutation: **fresh** `/ID` not in corpus and not previously sent.
- Unmodified byte-identical shell may keep donor `/ID` (whole file = orig).
- Forbidden: unequal `<A><B>` on Oracle receipts (that is iText / statement).
- Forbidden: same body + only `/ID` changed (SHA-only clone) → «номер документа не соответствует оригиналу».
- Forbidden: silent keep of donor `/ID` when regex replace fails.

Code: `alfa_sbp_stealth._ensure_fresh_oracle_trailer_id` / `_randomize_trailer_id` / `_trailer_id_reused` / `_oracle_trailer_invariant` (wired in phone/card + `emit_invariants`).

## Statement

- **Unequal** `/ID [<A><B>]` via `_itext_stamp_ids` — do not “fix” to equal.

## T-Bank

- Jasper may use unequal `/ID` — do **not** copy that onto Alfa Oracle.
